{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32818","headline":"送崔侍御书记赴山北座主尚书招辟 · 李频","name":"送崔侍御书记赴山北座主尚书招辟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书记向丘门，旌幢夹谷尊。\n从来游幕意，此去幷酬恩。\n雁呌嫌冰合，骢嘶喜雪繁。\n同爲入室士，不觉别销魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}